# Emrakul, the Aeons Torn: "Flying, protection from spells that are one or more colors, annihilator 6". On turn 2 Bot2
# lays out eight permanents. On turn 3 Bot1 casts Sneak Attack (Black Lotus, Mox Ruby and a Mountain) and puts Emrakul
# onto the battlefield with its {R} ability; hasty, it attacks, and annihilator 6 makes Bot2 sacrifice six of its eight
# permanents, keeping Sol Ring and Black Lotus. Emrakul's 15 flying damage leaves Bot2 at 5. At the end step Sneak Attack
# sacrifices Emrakul, and as it goes to the graveyard it shuffles the graveyard (the Lotus too) into the library.

